        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carly Gullickson, Francesca Schiavone, Chuang, Yan Zi, Chan Yung-jan, Abigail Spears, Květa Peschke, Rennae Stubbs, Lisa Raymond\n- Events: 2007 Zurich Open – Doubles, 2009 Hansol Korea Open – Doubles\n- Topics: professional tennis, doubles results\n\nFacts:\n- Francesca Schiavone turned professional in 1998.\n- Květa Peschke and Rennae Stubbs won the 2007 Zurich Open – Doubles final 7-5, 7-6 (1) against Lisa Raymond and Francesca Schiavone.\n- At the 2009 Hansol Korea Open – Doubles, Chuang partnered with Yan Zi and lost in the semifinals to Chan Yung-jan and Abigail Spears.\n- Francesca Schiavone was born on 23 June 1980 in Milan and is an Italian tennis player.\n- Carly Gullickson was born on November 26, 1986 and is a former American professional tennis player.",
